{#
mail/_crypto_banner.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
What a message's OpenPGP or S/MIME wrapping says, above the body.

Outside the frame for the reason every warning is (see _message_body): a lock
the mail could draw for itself would be worth nothing. Three symbols and no
more — encrypted, verified, a problem — each with one sentence; the details
(who signed, with which key) are the second line.

For an encrypted message the signature is inside the ciphertext, so the
browser fills that line in once it has decrypted (`signature` target of
mail--encrypted-message). For a signed one the server checked it in the
background (SignatureVerifier) and the state is on the row; null means the
check has not run yet.

Below that, for a PGP signature plMail cannot vouch for, what the person can
do about it (ContactKeyController): look the sender's key up in their
domain's WKD when plMail has none or a different one, trust the key when the
signature is intact but unconfirmed, or take a changed key as the sender's
new one. Plain forms, answered with a Turbo Stream that replaces this banner
— hence the id. For an encrypted message the browser shows the lookup itself
once it knows what the signature said (`signatureActions` target), because
only it does.

Variables:
  message      Message, with crypto set
  notice       optional translation key: what the last banner action did
  notice_tone  optional, 'success' or 'error'
#}
{% set crypto = message.crypto %}
{% set state = message.signatureState ? message.signatureState.value : null %}
{% set encrypted = crypto.encrypted %}
{% set warning = state in ['invalid', 'key_changed'] %}
{% set tone = encrypted or state == 'valid' ? 'secure' : (warning ? 'danger' : 'neutral') %}
{% set signer = message.signer ? (message.signer matches '/^[0-9a-f]+$/' ? message.signer|upper|split('', 4)|join(' ') : message.signer) : '' %}
{% set notice = notice|default(null) %}
{% set notice_tone = notice_tone|default('success') %}
{% set actions = not encrypted and crypto.pgp and state in ['unknown_key', 'untrusted', 'key_changed'] %}
{% set settings_url = path('app_settings_index', { section: 'encryption' }) ~ '#contact-keys' %}
{% set csrf = csrf_token('message-key-' ~ message.id) %}
{% set button = 'inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 h-7 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-raised hover:bg-hover text-ink border border-line transition-colors cursor-pointer' %}

<div id="crypto-banner-{{ message.id }}"
     class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border px-3 py-2.5 mb-3
            {{ tone == 'secure' ? 'border-emerald-500/40 bg-emerald-500/10' : (tone == 'danger' ? 'border-danger/40 bg-danger/10' : 'border-line bg-raised') }}"
     data-testid="crypto-banner">
    <i class="fa-solid {{ encrypted ? 'fa-lock' : (warning ? 'fa-triangle-exclamation' : (state == 'valid' ? 'fa-circle-check' : 'fa-signature')) }}
              {{ tone == 'secure' ? 'text-emerald-600' : (tone == 'danger' ? 'text-danger' : 'text-ink-faint') }} mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"
       aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <div class="min-w-0">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold {{ tone == 'danger' ? 'text-danger' : 'text-ink' }}">
            {% if encrypted %}
                {{ (message.plaintextSource.value == 'client' ? 'message.crypto.encrypted_kept' : (crypto.pgp ? 'message.crypto.encrypted' : 'message.crypto.encrypted_smime'))|trans }}
            {% else %}
                {{ ('message.crypto.signed.' ~ (state ?? 'pending'))|trans }}
            {% endif %}
        </p>
        {% if encrypted %}
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted break-words" data-mail--encrypted-message-target="signature" hidden></p>
            {# The subject the sender encrypted (RFC 9788): the outside said "...". #}
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted break-words" data-mail--encrypted-message-target="subject" data-testid="crypto-subject" hidden></p>
        {% elseif signer %}
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted break-words">{{ 'message.crypto.signer'|trans({ '%signer%': signer }) }}</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if actions %}
            {% if state == 'untrusted' %}
                <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1">{{ 'message.crypto.compare_hint'|trans }}</p>
            {% elseif state == 'key_changed' %}
                <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1">{{ 'message.crypto.key_changed_hint'|trans }}</p>
            {% endif %}

            <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                {% if state in ['unknown_key', 'key_changed'] %}
                    <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_contact_keys_message_lookup', { id: message.id }) }}">
                        <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf }}">
                        <button type="submit" class="{{ button }}">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            {{ 'message.crypto.action.lookup'|trans }}
                        </button>
                    </form>
                {% endif %}
                {% if state == 'untrusted' %}
                    <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_contact_keys_message_trust', { id: message.id }) }}">
                        <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf }}">
                        <button type="submit" class="{{ button }}">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            {{ 'message.crypto.action.trust'|trans }}
                        </button>
                    </form>
                {% endif %}
                {% if state == 'key_changed' %}
                    <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_contact_keys_message_accept', { id: message.id }) }}">
                        <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf }}">
                        <button type="submit" class="{{ button }}">{{ 'message.crypto.action.accept'|trans }}</button>
                    </form>
                {% endif %}
                <a href="{{ settings_url }}" class="text-xs font-medium text-link hover:underline">{{ 'message.crypto.action.manage'|trans }}</a>
            </div>
        {% elseif encrypted and crypto.pgp %}
            <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-mail--encrypted-message-target="signatureActions" hidden>
                <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_contact_keys_message_lookup', { id: message.id }) }}"
                      data-action="submit->mail--encrypted-message#lookUp">
                    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf }}">
                    <button type="submit" class="{{ button }}">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        {{ 'message.crypto.action.lookup'|trans }}
                    </button>
                </form>
                <a href="{{ settings_url }}" class="text-xs font-medium text-link hover:underline">{{ 'message.crypto.action.manage'|trans }}</a>
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if notice %}
            <p class="text-xs mt-2 {{ notice_tone == 'error' ? 'text-danger' : 'text-ink-muted' }}" role="status">{{ notice|trans }}</p>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</div>
